#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:im_livechat_ai.selection__im_livechat_channel__ai_backend_type__openai
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:im_livechat_ai.selection__llm_api_log__backend_type__openai
msgid "OpenAI compatible (LiteLLM, Hermes…)"
msgstr "OpenAI 相容（LiteLLM、Hermes…）"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:im_livechat_ai.field_im_livechat_channel__ai_api_token
msgid ""
"OpenAI compatible (required): the API key, sent as \"Authorization: Bearer "
"<token>\". n8n (optional): the signing secret of the X-Woow-Signature header"
" (HMAC-SHA256); it is never sent. Without it requests are not signed (a "
"public Chat Trigger). The saved token is never shown again; leave the field "
"empty to keep it."
msgstr ""
"OpenAI 相容（必填）：API 金鑰，以「Authorization: Bearer <token>」送出。n8n（選填）：X-Woow-"
"Signature 標頭的簽章密鑰（HMAC-SHA256），不會送出；不填則請求不簽章（例如公開的 Chat "
"Trigger）。儲存後不再顯示；留空即保留目前的金鑰。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:im_livechat_ai.field_im_livechat_channel__ai_model
msgid ""
"OpenAI compatible backends: the model name the backend expects (LiteLLM "
"needs it, for example chatgpt-pool/gpt-6-sol; Hermes ignores it). Not sent "
"when empty. Not used by n8n."
msgstr ""
"OpenAI 相容後端：後端需要的模型名稱（例如 LiteLLM 必填，如 chatgpt-pool/gpt-6-sol；Hermes "
"會忽略）。空白時不送出。n8n 不使用。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:im_livechat_ai.field_im_livechat_channel__ai_backend_type
msgid ""
"OpenAI compatible: any server with /v1/chat/completions, for example LiteLLM"
" or Hermes. n8n Webhook: an n8n workflow that starts with a Webhook node and"
" answers with \"Respond to Webhook\"."
msgstr ""
"OpenAI 相容：任何提供 /v1/chat/completions 的伺服器，例如 LiteLLM 或 Hermes。n8n Webhook：以 "
"Webhook 節點開始、用「Respond to Webhook」回覆的 n8n 工作流程。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:im_livechat_ai.field_im_livechat_channel__ai_endpoint_url
msgid ""
"OpenAI compatible: the base URL ending in /v1 (for example "
"https://litellm.example.com/v1); /chat/completions is added. n8n: the full "
"production webhook URL. Must start with https://; http:// is only accepted "
"for localhost, 127.0.0.1, ::1 and in-cluster hosts ending in "
".svc.cluster.local."
msgstr ""
"OpenAI 相容：結尾為 /v1 的基礎網址（例如 https://litellm.example.com/v1），系統會自動加上 "
"/chat/completions。n8n：完整的正式 Webhook 網址。必須以 https:// 開頭；只有 "
"localhost、127.0.0.1、::1 與結尾為 .svc.cluster.local 的叢集內主機可以用 http://。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields.selection,name:im_livechat_ai.selection__discuss_channel__ai_pause_reason__operator
msgid "Operator replied"
msgstr "客服已發言"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:im_livechat_ai.field_discuss_channel__ai_pause_reason
msgid ""
"Operator replied: the AI stays silent until the pause ends. Visitor asked "
"for a human: the AI waits for an operator; if none replies, it answers the "
"messages written meanwhile when the wait ends."
msgstr "客服已發言：暫停結束前 AI 不出聲。訪客要求真人：AI 等候客服接手；等候結束時若沒有客服回覆，AI 會回答等候期間的訊息。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:im_livechat_ai.field_im_livechat_channel__ai_system_prompt
