msgid ""
"Replies after a restart or deploy, and the AI answers after an unanswered\n"
"                            handoff wait, are sent by the cron \"Live Chat AI: Recover Reply Jobs\"\n"
"                            (every 2 minutes). A cron process must be running."
msgstr ""
"重啟或部署後遺留的回覆，以及等候真人逾時後的 AI 回覆，都由排程「Live Chat AI: Recover Reply Jobs」（每 2 "
"分鐘）送出，必須有排程程序在執行。"

