#. module: im_livechat_ai
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:im_livechat_ai.im_livechat_channel_view_form_inherit_ai
msgid ""
"When an operator posts in a conversation, the AI stays silent for the pause\n"
"                            minutes (every operator message extends it). When the visitor writes one of\n"
"                            the keywords, the visitor gets the handoff message, the operators are notified\n"
"                            and the AI waits for an operator; the first visitor message during the wait\n"
"                            gets the waiting notice once. If no operator replies before the wait ends, the\n"
"                            AI answers the messages the visitor wrote meanwhile."
msgstr ""
"客服在對話中發言後，AI 在暫停分鐘數內不出聲（客服每次發言都會延長）。訪客寫到關鍵字時，會收到轉接訊息、客服會收到通知，AI "
"開始等候客服接手；等候期間訪客的第一則訊息會收到一次等候通知。等候結束前若沒有客服回覆，AI 會回答訪客在等候期間寫的訊息。"

#. module: im_livechat_ai
